<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State-linked fighters killed dozens of civilians in Ebola-hit eastern DR Congo while Allied Democratic Forces militants attacked Cantine in North Kivu, adding to insecurity. A military court sentenced at least 66 Congolese soldiers to death for fleeing an FRN rebel attack, and the UN added Joseph Kabila's FRN to sanctions after formally linking it to M23. President Tshisekedi is paving the way for constitutional change, and WHO warns that conflict hampers Ebola containment as cases exceed 11,000 with 5,387 deaths. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE1ZM3Z4SVhSd0VjV3UyQUFtb1V3NUhmVHNJWXo5eEZmLUdjVzQ1SkV6Zkl3SzlhclEtRUJmcEZmVFdJeFNxbXU5YXN2cEpjY1pocnNxLWhvWVkyRnJCdF9ZTXotdHVWS3lXX0lKMWNOME90VjRDSFpmaTNNclc0eUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPZG1waG1xOHJUdGpBcUdNUXNmSUJ6bUctdFFZMmw4OVhPUmdUTzdSMVJWOFJ1N1dLWDVVcVh6MDY5VlRmT2tZSFJIWFZrU1E2RmxtV1JRaDE0Q3dJcEVtMHUza3Z2d1Bla3FMcWZqeUgxRjBZQ1pEODhzUHVHZHA0aFBSZXdlWElQU1JxbVE3cEtYS01Nel9XbUNxbGwwYXVVQVlCUHA4YTIyS0RjVTVPMQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5hWENNVUc2eUc4ajBIQlZ4aUF5RnF2TnJCVlFCY0RrNkhZbTBweGRlemxnbEY0ZTk0bl9CcnpFRTU2ZmdKSExyNzRMdnNnZlIzRjFoQ0dEMDV1YVlSV1HSAWNBVV95cUxQS1JVQ0YwOWdKbUs4QTlUWWFoSjZUbEhyRndCa1pvWnJPYW5KTHpoV0xqZnlwV3V6NkVnRHp4TzFJemFTcEpaYkxXNk9pVzFWaTZ0U2loXzBwMnFvYmNyamZzMmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOMThBUEkxX0dCOU40bUkyclZTOGZWS05teFBSNXFDLW5BVlc3UFdoS2FBQ2pFZV9FTTRqM